\begin_layout Subsubsection
SingleR:
 Reference-Based Annotation
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Cell type annotation is a critical step in single-cell analysis.
 We demonstrate how BiocPy enables the use of Bioconductor’s reference-based annotation tools directly within a Python environment,
 using the singler
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "aran_reference-based_2019,noauthor_singler-inc_nodate"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 package.
 This workflow highlights the ecosystem’s ability to fetch remote references and apply rigorous statistical methods,
 using the exact same algorithms available in R.
\end_layout

